@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}

<main class="container mt-4">
    <h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Effective date: @DateTime.UtcNow.ToString("MMMM d, yyyy")</p>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>Introduction</h2>
        <p>
            Welcome to Online Seeds Portal. Your privacy matters. This Privacy Policy explains what information we
            collect, how we use it, when we share it, and the choices you have with respect to your information when
            you use our website, products, and services (collectively, "Services").
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Information you provide:</strong> account details, name, email address, shipping address, and any messages you send us when creating orders or contacting support.</li>
            <li><strong>Payment information:</strong> we do not store full payment card numbers on our servers. Payment is processed via a third-party payment provider; we may retain references to transactions for order records.</li>
            <li><strong>Order and transaction data:</strong> products purchased, quantities, prices, and order history.</li>
            <li><strong>Automatically collected data:</strong> device and browser information, IP address, page interactions, and analytics data to improve the site.</li>
            <li><strong>Cookies and similar technologies:</strong> small files stored in your browser to enable shopping cart, sign-in, preferences, and analytics.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use information to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Process and fulfill orders, send order confirmations and shipping updates.</li>
            <li>Maintain your account and provide customer support.</li>
            <li>Improve, personalize, and secure our Services.</li>
            <li>Send promotional emails when you opt in; you can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
            <li>Comply with legal obligations and prevent fraud.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>Cookies, Local Storage & Cart</h2>
        <p>
            We use cookies and local storage to remember your cart contents, preferences, and authentication state.
            You can control cookies via your browser settings; disabling cookies may affect site functionality.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>Sharing & Third Parties</h2>
        <p>
            We may share your information with service providers who perform services on our behalf (payment processors,
            shipping carriers, analytics providers). We require these providers to protect your data and use it only for
            the purposes we specify. We will not sell your personal information to third parties.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>Security</h2>
        <p>
            We implement reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your data. While we strive to protect
            your information, no system is completely secure. If a data breach affecting your information occurs, we will
            notify you and relevant authorities when required by law.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>Your Rights</h2>
        <p>
            Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights including accessing, correcting, or deleting the personal
            information we hold about you; exporting your data; or objecting to certain processing. To exercise these rights,
            contact us at the address below. We may need to verify your identity before responding.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>
            Our Services are not directed at children under 16. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children
            without parental consent. If you believe we have collected personal data from a child, please contact us.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>Retention</h2>
        <p>
            We retain personal information as needed to provide Services, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes,
            and enforce our agreements. When no longer required, we securely delete or anonymize the information.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
            We may update this policy from time to time. If we make material changes, we will provide a prominent notice
            on the site or send you an email if you have an account. Continued use of the Services after the effective
            date constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
            If you have questions, requests, or concerns about your privacy, contact:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>Email: <a href="mailto:support@onlineseedsportal.com">support@onlineseedsportal.com</a></li>
            <li>Address: Online Seeds Portal, Street No 10/3 Usman Town, Millat Road, Faisalabad</li>
            <li>Address: Awan Zari Farms - Chak No 68 RB Jamiana, Via Khurrianwala, Faisalabad</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <footer class="mt-4 mb-5">
        <small class="text-muted">This Privacy Policy describes how Online Seeds Portal handles personal information. For
        order-specific questions, please visit your account orders page or contact customer support.</small>
    </footer>
</main>
